# fresh_start (plans/scenarios.md, SC1; scene S21): a game scenario
# whose seed is asked begins in the place chosen, at the time it
# states, with its setup applied (13 §4). `core:last_stand` asks for
# its seed, which `use` gives; its realm's clock is set to ten at night
# before anything is in the world; the character is placed in front of
# the house on the lane; `start.do` marks the nearest door of the house
# (two cells east of the old fixed offset, which was a wall), lights a
# lamp beside it and another inside, leaves a club and two bandages on
# the table, and brings the first of three strangers, tagged hostile;
# the others come later (decision D-909); both objectives are shown.
# The same answers give the same state hash, which the runner checks
# four ways and the golden hash below pins.
use default seed=7
begin core:last_stand place=0
assert "scenario_id() == 'core:last_stand'"
assert "@self.loc.time_of_day == 79200"
assert "@self.loc.x == 17 and @self.loc.y == 45"
assert "party()[0] == @self"
assert "objective_state('inside') == 'active' and objective_state('dawn') == 'active'"
assert "len(@self.objectives) == 2 and @self.objectives[0].where == 'north-east, 3 m'"
assert "str(@e:1.def) == 'core:club' and str(@e:2.def) == 'core:bandage'"
assert "@e:3.has_tag('hostile') and @e:3.has_tag('person')"
assert "not @self.has_tag('hostile')"
expect event scenario_started
advance 5s
assert "objective_state('inside') == 'active'"
expect hash 9fe422558cfd7c0950991f03a6fdcc9e
